# Operator credentials for scripts/db.sh (db:migrate, db:psql, db:proxy, db:run).
# Copy to .env.prod (gitignored, never committed) — db.sh loads it automatically.
# Not app config: the running service's own secrets still come from Secret
# Manager (see .env.example); this file only points your local tools at
# production through the Cloud SQL Auth Proxy, via terraform remote state.
# Needs gcloud auth with roles/cloudsql.client on the project (DEPLOYMENT.md §1.2).

TF_STATE_BUCKET=<project-id>-terraform-state
# ENVIRONMENT=production
# PROXY_PORT=5440
